#. :src: bpy.types.FFmpegSettings.codec:'FFV1'
msgid "FFmpeg video codec #1"
msgstr "FFmpeg-videokodek nr 1"

#. :src: bpy.types.FFmpegSettings.constant_rate_factor
msgid ""
"Constant Rate Factor (CRF); tradeoff between video quality and file size"
msgstr ""
"Constant Rate Factor (CRF); avvägning mellan videokvalitet och filstorlek"

#. :src: bpy.types.FFmpegSettings.constant_rate_factor:'CUSTOM'
msgid "Set a custom Constant Rate Factor (CRF)."
msgstr "Ange en anpassad Constant Rate Factor (CRF)."

#. :src: bpy.types.FFmpegSettings.custom_constant_rate_factor
msgid ""
"A smaller Constant Rate Factor (CRF) results in better video quality but "
"larger file size. The range of allowed CRF values is dependent on the codec."
msgstr ""
"Ett lägre CRF-värde ger bättre videokvalitet men större filstorlek. "
"Intervallet för tillåtna CRF-värden beror på kodeken."

#. :src: bpy.types.ImageFormatSettings.exr_codec
msgid "Compression codec settings for OpenEXR"
msgstr "Inställningar för komprimeringskodek för OpenEXR"

#: source/blender/imbuf/movie/intern/movie_write.cc:1515
msgid "Could not initialize streams, probably unsupported codec combination"
msgstr ""
"Kunde inte initiera strömmar, troligen på grund av en kombination av "
"kodekar som inte stöds"
